   "data": {
    "text": "EMOTIONAL ROAD\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 6, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Where this character is on their road\n   2 Where the film is on its road\n   3 Does the feeling turn\n   4 Hidden to shown\n   5 How far the feeling spreads\n   6 Catharsis\n   7 Feeling held in\n   8 suite: Emotional road lens\n   9 suite: Rock bottom\n  10 pair: When a character reaches their lowest point, their feeling turns\n  11 pair: After a low scene, a laugh\n  12 pair: A hidden feeling bursts out later\n  13 pair: After tension peaks, release follows\n  14 pair: When enough feeling is held in, it comes out\n  15 pairs: Emotional rollercoaster\n  16 pairs: The dam breaks"
